                                                "sense_id": "0b4f1357-7ab2-3d4a-8578-6b15755ab9c0",
                                                "text": "A small ornamental panel displayed the Great Central's slogan, \"Each Express is Vestibuled and has a Buffet Car attached.\" The buffet car is now being successfully exploited again by the L.N.E.R., but it is only last May that this facility returned to its parent line after a long absence."
